Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:56:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(x5): reverse-engineered network-framed BLE protocol
 + verified dual-camera capture

X5 (and newer models) speak the WiFi/TCP packet protocol over BLE instead
of Header16: [u32 length][0x04 MESSAGE/0x05 KEEPALIVE/0x06 SYNC]...
Confirmed on real hardware; commands, ACKs, keep-alives, host keep-alives,
reply matching and fragment reassembly are implemented (ProtoFormatNetwork,
pkg/protocol/netframe.go with captured-vector tests). Dual X5 record
start/stop now works: dispatch spread <=50us, both cameras produce files.

Adds cmd/x5probe (protocol experiment tool) and updates docs.
